s unkillable earning  him the title of strongest creature in  the world his former crewmates as well  as fellow former yonko herself charlotte  linlin ruled over the totland  archipelago as well as being a prominent  pirate for the last 60 years much like  kaido linlin would go on to produce her  own personal army although she did it in  a more literal sense aiming to have  children from each race other than  giants and to form a pseudo-peaceful  utopia where all races could belong she  would go on to have 85 children with 43  husbands over the last 42 years and as  such it makes a lot of sense that she  would be called big mom in our last  entry into the new guard we have sengoku  the former fleet admiral of the marines  who was considered to be one of the  strongest marines from rogers generation  going on to lead the marines until their  victory at marine ford against the  whitebeard pirates his strategic mind  earned him the title of the resourceful  general but he also had a much more  straightforward name the buddha which  instead was a reference to the devil  fruit that he used in either vein he's  supposed to be a symbol of wisdom and  guidance among the marines first of our  current age of yonkos is shanks shanks  is another character who is filled with  mysteries but it feels like we're on the  verge of knowing his true intentions  however it would seem that his overall  goal is to stop blackbeard shanks  himself is of course a former apprentice  on rogers crew as well as being the  inspiration for luffy to set sail unlike  the former yonko shanks doesn't have a  title about his strength in fact none of  this generation of yonko do which is  pretty interesting instead he's simply  called red hair shanks that said much  like how odin's name demands respect as  soon as anyone hears red hair they do  jump to it being shanks and like owning  an entire hair color is pretty  impressive in itself doflamingo the only  celestial dragon that we know of with  conquerors haki led the don quixote  pirates ultimately earning a spot as a  warlord and giving him carte blanche  access to conquer dressrosa and become  its king for the last decade all while  he also ruled the underworld under the  codename joker fitting for someone who  would bring smiles to wano finally  doffy's epithet the heavenly demon or  heavenly yasha is in reference to him  being a celestial dragon who now aims to  destroy everything and the last of our  midpoint conquerors is of course  katakuri second son of big mom and one  of her sweet commanders he is considered  to be the strongest member of her crew  and rules over komugi island as its  minister we unfortunately don't know a  lot about where khan curry is going  based on recent manga events but i would  imagine that he's likely going to get a  title based on his actions from this  point on finally on to the new age of  conquerors starting of course with  monkey d luffy captain of the straw hats  and leader of the grand fleet of 5 000  members the man aiming to be the next  pirate king the return of joy boy an  inheritor of both roger's will and the  mythical nika devil fruit he is the  former fifth emperor and current new  yonko and it's pretty straightforward to  see why luffy has conquerors haki when  you consider everything involved around  his character at this point but what is  interesting to note is that luffy is  seemingly the only one on a list who has  no interest in conquering others instead  he has this innate ability to garner the  trust respect and loyalty of anyone  whose path he crosses and he simply  wants to be the most free obviously  luffy's title is straw hat but that  raises some interesting questions like  what he's going to be called once he  gives the hat back to shanks and how  that connects both of these two  characters to the giant straw hat under  marijuana luffy's first mate zorro also  has conquerors haki it's constantly a  joke in the series that zorro seems like  he would be more capable of being  captain because of the air that he  carries himself with and that makes a  lot of sense considering that both of  them are conquerors zoro's dream isn't  to become king of the pirates though or  even captain instead he wants to become  the world's greatest swordsman so that  his name can become famous enough to  reach quina in heaven and of course  zorro's title is pirate hunter a  reference to his bounty hunting days in  the east blue yamato our newest  potential straw hat as of right now is  the child of kaido and was as such given  the title of oni princess namato's goal  is to be free similar to luffy however  this is in a much more literal sense  since they've always been trapped on  wano by kaido and now that kaido's been  defeated it looks like they might have  their chance to become free luffy's  brother ace also had conquerors he  originally wanted to become pirate king  himself but decided to put all of his  efforts into making whitebeard the  pirate king he was given the title fire  fists in reference to his devil fruit as  well as his signature attack eustis kid  is also aiming to become king of the  pirates however he seems to be the most  willing to do anything to reach that  goal while luffy aims to become pirate  king he tries to do things that are  morally good while he does so kid on the  other hand is willing to straight up  execute anyone in his way kid's epithet  is less than creative but he is called  eustis captain kid and our final canon  conqueror user is boa hancock the pirate  empress of amazon lily the captain of  the kuja pirates and the former warlord  hancock was a slave to the celestial  dragons early on in her life and has  made it her goal to rise above everyone  else so that she can never be looked  down on again hancock's titles are both  based on her position in amazon lily  being snake princess and pirate empress  and i've always kind of wondered how big  mom felt about her being called pirate  empress considering that big mom was one  of the four emperors and that title  likely would have made a lot more sense  for her but either way let's move on to  the final two members who are non-canon  users firstly niguri this is the old man  that trained luffy sabo and ace when  they were young he's a former pirate  captain who battled roger but was easily  defeated and we don't really know a lot  about him and i highly doubt we ever  will but when he left grey terminal his  dream of reuniting with his former crew  was reignited and finally we have  douglas bullet the former member of  rogers crew who was captured and kept an  impel down for 20 years until luffy's  great escape when he got out bullet set  himself on becoming pirate king and to  reach this goal we would even see him  taking on  this can't be right the script says he  took on everyone  uh one sec  [Music]  okay having just watched stampede for  the first time he did in fact take on  everyone  also the movie was pretty cool so check  it out if you haven't regardless for his  general ruthlessness and desire to  follow in his former captain's footsteps  bullet was given the title of demon air  and that's it we have officially covered  what conquerors is how it's used who can  use it and why those characters are  considered conquerors honestly this is a  really fun video to work on because  there's a lot of things i didn't really  notice about conkers in the past like  that the only non-pirate user is sengoku  or that if they aren't captains they  only work in the crews of other  conquerors users all really cool stuff  in my opinion but let me know what you  think in the comments and if you knew  those little details you can also let me  know if there's any other characters  that you think might have conquered that  we don't know about as always though if  you've enjoyed this video remember to  leave a like and a comment down below  letting us know what you thought and of  course if you aren't subscribed remember  to hit that button to stay up to date  with all the great content we have in  store for you finally you can follow us  over on twitter at anime uproar or you  can follow my own channel axel beats if  you're looking for more from me  personally with all that being said  though thank you so much for watching  and until next time remember to stay  excellent
 

